The dataset does not appear to have a standard:

dataset_root/
    class_1/
    class_2/
    class_3/

folder structure.

The easiest solution is to add a Kaggle Mars classification
dataset organized by class folders.

NASA's original dataset has label files rather than the
standard Keras folder structure.
"""
